~ notice

arc_officer: This is a formal notice. Your books have been in the red for some time and the Corporation is not a charity.
arc_officer: Settle it within a few cycles or we move to repossess. We can advance you the money, at our usual terms.

- Accept an ARC loan
	$> station.loan(2500)
	arc_officer: Twenty-five hundred, repaid at twenty per cent over the coming cycles. Try to enjoy it.
	=> END
- Weather it
	arc_officer: Optimism. We will make a note of that.
	=> END
